{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:df3e0192b05e2e63","name":"Ion Grenade","source":{"id":"source:reference-df3e0192b05e2e63","title":"Ion Grenade","revision":18289,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:54:33Z","sha256":"0cb06bd9ca1d6ff532285239df4f4b55d919136b48a0493a3aedf987361eb612","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18289","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ion%20Grenade&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-df3e0192b05e2e63","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When the object of a mission is to capture ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},", mercenary units, military personnel, and local law enforcement agencies use Ion Grenades. The standard Ion Grenade unleashes a brief electrostatic pulse that disables electronic targets within its 2-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. It is designed to explode on contact after it is thrown, effectively dealing damage in the same round it is hurled.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," with an Ion Grenade, you make a single attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of every target in the Grenade's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},", electronic devices, and cybernetically enhanced creatures you hit take normal damage, and those you miss take half damage. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent takes half damage from a successful attack, and no damage if the attack misses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage has a chance of pushing such targets down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". Creatures without cybernetics take half of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage on a hit, or no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage on a miss, and they suffer no other ill effects.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 250\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 4d6 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," Radius:"]}," 2-Squares\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
